WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.595
Today the missing letter is at the end of the word.

2
00:00:03.045 --> 00:00:09.857
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.357 --> 00:00:12.936
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:13.436 --> 00:00:17.682
The end of a word is harder to hear than the start. So say the word slowly.

5
00:00:18.132 --> 00:00:22.584
Say the name of the first picture. Tub. Ask: what is the last sound?

6
00:00:23.818 --> 00:00:25.171
Bat first, then ball.

7
00:00:28.201 --> 00:00:29.228
The word is tub.

8
00:00:30.128 --> 00:00:32.345
Here is one with the other letter. Lid.

9
00:00:33.674 --> 00:00:35.959
The round part first, then up and down.

10
00:00:39.533 --> 00:00:40.555
The word is lid.

11
00:00:41.455 --> 00:00:45.175
Do two pictures together. Then your child carries on with the page.

12
00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:49.542
For job two, press play on your child's listening track and step away.

13
00:00:49.992 --> 00:00:52.504
At the end, your child reads three words to you.
